  "description": "The Inceptor from Stay Strong is their introductory level bike range and has specifically chosen geometry and specs on each bike to suit the individual rider! Though being an entry level bike it's spec'd with parts usually seen on mid to pro range level bikes. Highlights of the inceptor include, Chromoly 3pc cranks, fully sealed bearings throughout, integrated headtube and mid BB, 2.40\" tyres and 25/9t gearing with sealed 9t cassette hub. The Inceptor has options for every rider! Please note: This version of the Stay Strong Inceptor BMX features a 20.25\" top tube making it a slightly smaller full size BMX. ###section### Product Specs\n\nSealed bearings throughout Strong and durable crankset Strong Hi-ten steel construction ###shogun-image-section###",
